\begin_layout Proof
נניח ש-
\begin_inset Formula
$\left(\MKclc_{g}\left(v_{1}\right);\MKclc_{g}\left(v_{2}\right);\ldots;\MKclc_{g}\left(v_{n}\right)\right)$
